  "title": "Perplexity AI's Sonar API: A New Power Player in Real-Time AI Search",
  "summary": "Perplexity AI introduces Sonar, a cutting-edge real-time AI search API, directly competing with Google and OpenAI. With real-time web connectivity and superior performance metrics, Sonar sets a new standard in AI search, achieving an impressive 85.8 F-score on the SimpleQA benchmark and winning over Zoom as an early adopter. Discover how Sonar's unique advantages and competitive pricing structure position it as a formidable contender in the AI search landscape.",
